# ================================================================
# 5. CONCEPT ANNOTATION
# ================================================================
#
# These are the concepts whose attention we want to measure.
#
# concrete:
#   directly visualizable entities
#
# metaphorical:
#   abstract / semantic concepts
#
# ================================================================

